  "name": "Example: Identifying Values in the Range of the Inverse Cosine Function",
  "problem": "Which of the following values is in the range of $y=\\arccos x?$\n\n- $-\\dfrac \\pi 2$\n\n- $0$\n\n- $\\pi$",
